From: =?UTF-8?q?Ersin=20KO=C3=87?= <ersinkoc@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:52:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(platform): no macOS notification yet (osascript posts
 as Script Editor); Windows says when notifications are off

Merger's pick (a) on #296: Windows and Linux notify; macOS desktop_notify returns Unsupported and the docs say a silent Mac is
expected for now (the app's own UNUserNotificationCenter is the follow-up). Windows: the toast script exits 3 when
ToastNotifier.Setting is not Enabled, reported as PermissionDenied (windows' suggestion 1).
