 crates/agora-platform/src/macos.rs      | 26 +++++--------------------
 crates/agora-platform/src/winservice.rs | 13 ++++++++-----
 docs/backlog/phase-7.md                 |  2 +-
 6 files changed, 30 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
